        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='54300' hidden-by-user='true' id='437' type-v2='text' w='55000' x='30779' y='7600'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>This dashboard aims to track the performance of an email marketing campaign consisting of a series of emails. It is based on the client work I have done previously. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>It helps to answer questions like:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>1. How good is the email marketing campaign performing overall?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>2. How does each email of the marketing campaign perform?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>3. How does our current performance compare to the performance of the previous month, previous year or same month last year?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>4. What are the historical trends?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>5. How does a typical email journey of our customers look like?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>6. How many people do we have to chase and how many people are booking/qualifying straight ahead?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>Use the help icon (?) to learn how you can interact with the dashboard.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>Abbreviations:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>CM vs CM PY = Current Month vs Current Month Previous Year</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>CM vs PM = Current Month vs Previous Month</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>CY vs PY = Current Year vs Previous Year</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>YTD vs PYTD = Year to Date vs Previous Year to Date</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>Design: Marius Nikiforovas @VizMarius</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>Dataset: Marius Nikiforovas @VizMarius</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>Inspiration: Chimdi Nwosu @DatavizChimdi</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>Credits: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>LinkedIn Icon was made by Freepik and is available to download here: </run>
            <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#787878' fontsize='10' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/linkedin_174857&amp;quot;'>https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/linkedin_174857</run>
            <run fontcolor='#787878' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='10'>Twitter Icon was made by Freepik and is available to download here</run>
            <run fontcolor='#787878' fontsize='10'>: </run>
            <run auto-url='true' fontcolor='#787878' fontsize='10' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/twitter_1384065?term=twitter&amp;amp;page=1&amp;amp;position=12&amp;amp;origin=search&amp;amp;related_id=1384065&amp;quot;'>https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/twitter_1384065?term=twitter&amp;page=1&amp;position=12&amp;origin=search&amp;related_id=1384065</run>
          </formatted-text>
