            <zone h='11500' id='374' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98770' x='615' y='8400'>
              <zone fixed-size='1117' forceUpdate='true' h='9300' id='377' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='73831' x='3277' y='9500'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>This Tableau project was built using </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ee1c4d' fontsize='11'>Python</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'> to generate fake customer email data and display both my Python and Tableau abilities. A summary of things done is outlined below and a more </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ee1c4d' fontsize='11'>detailed descriptio</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ee1c4d' fontsize='11'>n</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'> together with Python scripts can be found on my </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ee1c4d' fontsize='11'>GitHub</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'> page (click the button on the right). </run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='10' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='10' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone alt-text='Click to view on GitHub' h='9300' id='376' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Group 1 (1).png' type-v2='bitmap' url='https://github.com/Marius321/Email-Marketing-Campaign-Dashboard' w='19615' x='77108' y='9500'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='12' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                <format attr='margin' value='20' />
                <format attr='margin-top' value='10' />
                <format attr='margin-right' value='40' />
                <format attr='margin-bottom' value='10' />
                <format attr='margin-left' value='40' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#1b242cb4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='351' h='35100' id='14' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98770' x='615' y='19900'>
              <zone fixed-size='628' h='35100' id='406' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='42078' x='2563' y='19900'>
                <zone fixed-size='214' forceUpdate='true' h='32900' id='362' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='13896' x='3277' y='21000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>1. Tech set up &amp; Inspiration</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>I used  Spyder IDE (Anaconda) to generate code in Python 3.9. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>The viz was inspired by Chimdi Nwosu viz #RWFD NYC Community Service Requests, screenshotted on the right.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='20' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#1b242cb4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone h='32900' id='400' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Inspiration.PNG' type-v2='bitmap' w='26754' x='17173' y='21000'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin-right' value='0' />
                    <format attr='padding-top' value='10' />
                    <format attr='padding-right' value='0' />
                    <format attr='padding-bottom' value='10' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#1b242cb4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='10' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='356' forceUpdate='true' h='35100' id='367' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='24416' x='44641' y='19900'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>2. Writing code</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>There are three Python scripts used to generate the datasets for this project:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>1. Email Data Generating Script - generates</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ee1c4d' fontsize='11'>fake data</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>and email metrics</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>2. Filtering Script -</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ee1c4d' fontsize='11'>filters</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>the output from the previous script based on certain percentiles</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>3. Sankey Script - transforms data into a suitable format for building a</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ee1c4d' fontsize='11'>Sankey Funnel Chart</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='10' />
                  <format attr='padding' value='20' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#1b242cb4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='35100' id='399' type-v2='text' w='28380' x='69057' y='19900'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>3. Tableau Functionality</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>- Parameter and select actions</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#e5e5e5' fontsize='11'>- Navigation buttons</run>
